    <node id="SURGEON (ENTITY ID: 795)">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">SURGEON is a medical professional who specializes in performing surgical procedures. As a physician, the surgeon may also provide cancer genetics counseling and perform diagnostic procedures such as skin biopsies. In the context of cancer care, the surgeon is skilled in identifying and locating sentinel lymph nodes, which are key to determining whether cancer has spread. Thus, the surgeon’s role combines operative expertise with diagnostic and counseling responsibilities in patient care.
Relationships: None present in the provided relationship table.</data>
