    <node id="MYCHART (ENTITY ID: 92)">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">MyChart is a patient portal and online electronic health record system that patients can set up to manage their healthcare. It provides secure access to test results, allows users to track appointments, and enables communication with their care team. Available as an account system when offered by a healthcare provider, MyChart serves as a centralized digital tool for patients to stay engaged with their health information and care coordination.
Relationships:
  - Source: MYCHART
  - Target: PHYSICIAN
  - Description: MyChart (the patient portal) messages are not immediately seen by a physician. Because of this, any urgent concerns should not be sent through MyChart or portal messaging; instead, they should be called directly to triage. Physicians do not monitor MyChart messages in real time, so portal messaging is not appropriate for time-sensitive or urgent medical issues.</data>
