    Description: Chemoradiation is a treatment option for bladder cancer. 
  - Source: CHEMORADIATION
    Target: Stage 2 or 3 rectal cancer
    Description: Chemoradiation is a possible next treatment for stage 2 or 3 rectal cancer. 
