    <node id="CERVICAL CANCER — CHEMORADIATION IS AN ESTABLISHED TREATMENT STRATEGY FOR CERVICAL CANCER. CHEMOTHERAPY IS COMBINED WITH RADIATION AS CHEMORADIATION, OFTEN GIVEN ONCE WEEKLY, AND RADIATION THERAPY FOR CERVICAL CANCER INCLUDES EXTERNAL BEAM RADIATION THERAPY AND BRACHYTHERAPY. PLATINUM CHEMOTHERAPY IS ALSO COMMONLY ADMINISTERED WITH EXTERNAL BEAM RADIATION THERAPY AS PART OF A CHEMORADIATION REGIMEN FOR CERVICAL CANCER. THERAPEUTIC RELATION: TREATS/MANAGES [DATA: ENTITIES (146, 43, 39, 855, 148, +MORE)].">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
