    <node id="LOCALLY ADVANCED CERVICAL CANCER — CHEMORADIATION IS RECOMMENDED FOR LOCALLY ADVANCED CERVICAL CANCER. FOR THIS CONDITION, CHEMORADIATION CONSISTS OF EXTERNAL BEAM RADIATION THERAPY (EBRT) GIVEN CONCURRENTLY WITH CHEMOTHERAPY, USUALLY PLATINUM-BASED CHEMOTHERAPY. A TYPICAL SCHEDULE INCLUDES 5 EBRT SESSIONS PER WEEK FOR 5 TO 6 WEEKS, ALONG WITH WEEKLY CHEMOTHERAPY. THERAPEUTIC RELATION: TREATS [DATA: ENTITIES (146, 997)].">
