    <edge source="NEUROSURGEON" target="BIOPSY" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The neurosurgeon is a specialist who performs surgical biopsy procedures, including stereotactic biopsy and resection, to obtain tissue samples for diagnostic evaluation. These biopsy procedures are conducted in the operating room, ensuring a controlled and sterile environment for the patient. (Relationship id: 1556)</data>
