    <edge source="MYCHART" target="PHYSICIAN" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">MyChart (the patient portal) messages are not immediately seen by a physician. Because of this, any urgent concerns should not be sent through MyChart or portal messaging; instead, they should be called directly to triage. Physicians do not monitor MyChart messages in real time, so portal messaging is not appropriate for time-sensitive or urgent medical issues.</data>
      <data key="d8">PHYSICIAN (Entity ID: 710)</data>
